≤m≤15。"},{"t":"如下图所示："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20250216/17396933327094.png"},{"t":"【输出描述】"},{"t":"新建列表“list”用于存储 N 字矩阵。"},{"t":"如下图所示："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20250216/17396933385969.png"},{"t":"【输入样例】"},{"t":"m = 5"},{"t":"【输出样例】"},{"t":"list = ['A+++A', 'AA++A', 'A+A+A', 'A++AA', 'A+++A']"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20250216/17396933525726.png"},{"t":"注意："},{"t":"1、 变量名的拼写（包括大小写）要和题目完全一致。"},{"t":"2、 输入变量直接赋值即可，无需使用“询问并等待”积木块。"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2024","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}